{
  "name": "MEGA·3 MONEY & OPS BRAIN — orders + live rates + stock POs + payment links + nightly sync/recon/backup/digest",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {"content": "# 🧠 MEGA·3 — MONEY & OPS BRAIN\nThe whole back-office in ONE workflow, five sections.\n\n**A · ORDERS (webhook `order-in`)** — Shopify/site/WhatsApp order → logged + stock decremented + COD flagged + one-tap thank-you.\n**B · LIVE RATES (9:00 & 14:00)** — metals API → ₹/g 24K/22K + local premium → Rates tab auto-filled → threshold 📈/📉 alerts. Everything downstream (calculator, posters, quotes) feeds itself.\n**C · STOCK (9:15)** — low-stock → Telegram card → ✅ tap approves → supplier wa.me PO drafted.\n**D · PAYMENTS (10:30)** — Dues rows → real Razorpay links + one-tap send; 3-day polite chase list.\n**E · NIGHT BLOCK (21:30)** — one timer does FOUR jobs: Zoho Books invoice sync → Razorpay-vs-orders reconciliation → Drive backup of the master sheet → owner day-digest.\n\n**KEYS:** METALS_API_KEY · LOCAL_PREMIUM_PCT · RATE_ALERT_ABOVE/BELOW · Razorpay basic-auth credential · Zoho OAuth + ZB_ORG_ID · TG_OWNER_CHAT_ID · N8N_BASE_URL · BRAND_NAME · REPLACE_SHEET_ID + REPLACE_BACKUP_FOLDER_ID.\nTabs: Orders, Stock, Rates, Dues.\n\n**🔧 FIX:** rate odd → premium % or unit (node B2 converts oz→g if needed) · PO buttons dead → workflow must be Active · recon mismatch daily → COD excluded already; check manual bills · Zoho 401 → wrong DC (.in).", "height": 640, "width": 570},
      "id": "n0", "name": "README", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [-650, -300]
    },
    {"parameters": {"content": "## A · ORDERS INTAKE", "height": 70, "width": 1000}, "id": "sA", "name": "SecA", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [0, -180]},
    {"parameters": {"httpMethod": "POST", "path": "order-in", "responseMode": "onReceived", "options": {}}, "id": "a1", "name": "A1 webhook order-in", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [20, -80]},
    {"parameters": {"jsCode": "const b=$json.body||{};const li=b.line_items?.[0]||{};\nreturn [{ json: { OrderID:b.id||b.order_id||('ORD-'+Date.now()), Date:new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10), Customer:b.customer?((b.customer.first_name||'')+' '+(b.customer.last_name||'')).trim():(b.customer_name||b.customer||'Customer'), Phone:b.phone||b.customer?.phone||'', Item:li.title||b.item||'', Qty:li.quantity||b.qty||1, Amount:b.total_price||b.amount||'', Payment:(String(b.financial_status||b.payment||'')).toLowerCase().includes('cod')?'COD':'Prepaid', ShipStatus:'New', Synced:'' } }];"}, "id": "a2", "name": "A2 normalise", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [200, -80]},
    {"parameters": {"operation": "append", "documentId": {"__rl": true, "value": "REPLACE_SHEET_ID", "mode": "id"}, "sheetName": {"__rl": true, "value": "Orders", "mode": "name"}, "columns": {"mappingMode": "autoMapInputData"}, "options": {}}, "id": "a3", "name": "A3 log order", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets", "typeVersion": 4.5, "position": [380, -140], "credentials": {"googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Google Sheets"}}},
    {"parameters": {"documentId": {"__rl": true, "value": "REPLACE_SHEET_ID", "mode": "id"}, "sheetName": {"__rl": true, "value": "Stock", "mode": "name"}, "options": {}}, "id": "a4", "name": "A4 read stock", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets", "typeVersion": 4.5, "position": [380, -20], "credentials": {"googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Google Sheets"}}},
    {"parameters": {"jsCode": "const o=$('A2 normalise').item.json;const row=items.map(i=>i.json).find(r=>(r.Item||'').toLowerCase()===(o.Item||'').toLowerCase());\nif(!row) return [];\nreturn [{ json: { row_number: row.row_number, Qty: Math.max(0, Number(row.Qty||0)-Number(o.Qty||1)) } }];"}, "id": "a5", "name": "A5 new qty", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [560, -20]},
    {"parameters": {"operation": "update", "documentId": {"__rl": true, "value": "REPLACE_SHEET_ID", "mode": "id"}, "sheetName": {"__rl": true, "value": "Stock", "mode": "name"}, "columns": {"mappingMode": "autoMapInputData", "matchingColumns": ["row_number"]}, "options": {}}, "id": "a6", "name": "A6 decrement", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets", "typeVersion": 4.5, "position": [740, -20], "credentials": {"googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Google Sheets"}}},
    {"parameters": {"operation": "sendMessage", "chatId": "={{$env.TG_OWNER_CHAT_ID}}", "text": "={{ $('A2 normalise').item.json.Payment==='COD' ? '⚠ COD — VERIFY BEFORE DISPATCH\\n' : '🛍️ ' }}ORDER {{ $('A2 normalise').item.json.OrderID }}: {{ $('A2 normalise').item.json.Customer }} — {{ $('A2 normalise').item.json.Item }} ×{{ $('A2 normalise').item.json.Qty }} ₹{{ $('A2 normalise').item.json.Amount }}\n👉 https://wa.me/{{ String($('A2 normalise').item.json.Phone).replace(/\\D/g,'') }}?text={{ encodeURIComponent('Namaste '+$('A2 normalise').item.json.Customer+' ji! Your order is confirmed 💛 — '+($env.BRAND_NAME||'')) }}", "additionalFields": {}}, "id": "a7", "name": "A7 order alert", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram", "typeVersion": 1.2, "position": [560, -140], "credentials": {"telegramApi": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Jeweller Bot"}}},
    {"parameters": {"content": "## B · LIVE RATES + THRESHOLDS", "height": 70, "width": 1000}, "id": "sB", "name": "SecB", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [0, 120]},
    {"parameters": {"rule": {"interval": [{"field": "cronExpression", "expression": "0 9,14 * * *"}]}}, "id": "b1", "name": "B1 9:00 & 14:00", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger", "typeVersion": 1.2, "position": [20, 220]},
    {"parameters": {"url": "=https://api.metals.dev/v1/latest?api_key={{$env.METALS_API_KEY}}&currency=INR&unit=g", "options": {"response": {"response": {"neverError": true}}}}, "id": "b2", "name": "B2 metals API", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [200, 220]},
    {"parameters": {"jsCode": "const m=$json.metals||{};let g24=Number(m.gold||0);\nif(!g24&&$json.rates?.XAU) g24=Number($json.rates.XAU)/31.1035;\nif(!g24) throw new Error('No rate — check provider');\nconst prem=1+Number($env.LOCAL_PREMIUM_PCT||2)/100;\nconst r24=Math.round(g24*prem), r22=Math.round(r24*0.916);\nconst hi=Number($env.RATE_ALERT_ABOVE||999999), lo=Number($env.RATE_ALERT_BELOW||0);\nlet alert='';\nif(r24>=hi) alert=`📈 24K crossed ₹${hi} → ₹${r24}/g. Message fence-sitters: 'rates rising — book now'.`;\nif(r24<=lo) alert=`📉 24K below ₹${lo} → ₹${r24}/g. Buying window — alert scheme members.`;\nreturn [{ json: { Date:new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10), Rate24K:r24, Rate22K:r22, RateSilver: Math.round(Number(m.silver||0)*prem)||'', alert } }];"}, "id": "b3", "name": "B3 convert + thresholds", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [380, 220]},
    {"parameters": {"operation": "appendOrUpdate", "documentId": {"__rl": true, "value": "REPLACE_SHEET_ID", "mode": "id"}, "sheetName": {"__rl": true, "value": "Rates", "mode": "name"}, "columns": {"mappingMode": "defineBelow", "value": {"Date": "={{$json.Date}}", "Rate24K": "={{$json.Rate24K}}", "Rate22K": "={{$json.Rate22K}}", "RateSilver": "={{$json.RateSilver}}"}, "matchingColumns": ["Date"]}, "options": {}}, "id": "b4", "name": "B4 write rates", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets", "typeVersion": 4.5, "position": [560, 220], "credentials": {"googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Google Sheets"}}},
    {"parameters": {"operation": "sendMessage", "chatId": "={{$env.TG_OWNER_CHAT_ID}}", "text": "=🪙 24K ₹{{$json.Rate24K}}/g · 22K ₹{{$json.Rate22K}}/g (auto-fed everywhere){{ $json.alert ? '\\n\\n'+$json.alert : '' }}", "additionalFields": {}}, "id": "b5", "name": "B5 rate ping", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram", "typeVersion": 1.2, "position": [740, 220], "credentials": {"telegramApi": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Jeweller Bot"}}},
    {"parameters": {"content": "## C · LOW-STOCK → ONE-TAP PO", "height": 70, "width": 1000}, "id": "sC", "name": "SecC", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [0, 400]},
    {"parameters": {"rule": {"interval": [{"field": "cronExpression", "expression": "15 9 * * *"}]}}, "id": "c1", "name": "C1 9:15", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger", "typeVersion": 1.2, "position": [20, 500]},
    {"parameters": {"documentId": {"__rl": true, "value": "REPLACE_SHEET_ID", "mode": "id"}, "sheetName": {"__rl": true, "value": "Stock", "mode": "name"}, "options": {}}, "id": "c2", "name": "C2 read stock", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets", "typeVersion": 4.5, "position": [200, 500], "credentials": {"googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Google Sheets"}}},
    {"parameters": {"jsCode": "return items.filter(i=>Number(i.json.Qty)<=Number(i.json.MinQty||0)).map(i=>({json:i.json}));"}, "id": "c3", "name": "C3 low items", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [380, 500]},
    {"parameters": {"operation": "sendMessage", "chatId": "={{$env.TG_OWNER_CHAT_ID}}", "text": "=📦 LOW: {{$json.Item}} — {{$json.Qty}} left (min {{$json.MinQty}})\n✅ Approve PO: {{$env.N8N_BASE_URL}}/webhook/po-tap?item={{ encodeURIComponent($json.Item) }}&sup={{ encodeURIComponent($json.SupplierPhone||'') }}&qty=5", "additionalFields": {}}, "id": "c4", "name": "C4 low-stock card", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram", "typeVersion": 1.2, "position": [560, 500], "credentials": {"telegramApi": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Jeweller Bot"}}},
    {"parameters": {"httpMethod": "GET", "path": "po-tap", "responseMode": "responseNode", "options": {}}, "id": "c5", "name": "C5 webhook po-tap", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [20, 620]},
    {"parameters": {"jsCode": "const q=$json.query||{};const msg=`Namaste! Please arrange: ${q.item} — qty ${q.qty||5}. Confirm price & delivery. — ${$env.BRAND_NAME||''}`;\nreturn [{ json: { html: `<h2>PO drafted ✔</h2><p><a style='font-size:22px' href='https://wa.me/${String(q.sup||'').replace(/\\D/g,'')}?text=${encodeURIComponent(msg)}'>👉 Send to supplier on WhatsApp</a></p>` } }];"}, "id": "c6", "name": "C6 draft PO", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [200, 620]},
    {"parameters": {"respondWith": "text", "responseBody": "={{$json.html}}", "options": {"responseHeaders": {"entries": [{"name": "Content-Type", "value": "text/html"}]}}}, "id": "c7", "name": "C7 respond", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook", "typeVersion": 1.1, "position": [380, 620]},
    {"parameters": {"content": "## D · PAYMENT LINKS + CHASE", "height": 70, "width": 1000}, "id": "sD", "name": "SecD", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [0, 740]},
    {"parameters": {"rule": {"interval": [{"field": "cronExpression", "expression": "30 10 * * *"}]}}, "id": "d1", "name": "D1 10:30", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger", "typeVersion": 1.2, "position": [20, 840]},
    {"parameters": {"documentId": {"__rl": true, "value": "REPLACE_SHEET_ID", "mode": "id"}, "sheetName": {"__rl": true, "value": "Dues", "mode": "name"}, "options": {}}, "id": "d2", "name": "D2 read dues", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets", "typeVersion": 4.5, "position": [200, 840], "credentials": {"googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Google Sheets"}}},
    {"parameters": {"jsCode": "const cut=new Date(Date.now()-3*864e5).toISOString().slice(0,10);\nconst rows=items.map(i=>i.json);\nconst fresh=rows.filter(r=>!r.LinkSent&&r.Amount&&r.Phone).map(r=>({json:{...r,mode:'new'}}));\nconst chase=rows.filter(r=>r.LinkSent&&r.LinkSent<=cut&&(r.PaidStatus||'').toLowerCase()!=='paid').map(r=>({json:{...r,mode:'chase'}}));\nreturn [...fresh, ...chase];"}, "id": "d3", "name": "D3 split new/chase", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [380, 840]},
    {"parameters": {"conditions": {"options": {}, "conditions": [{"leftValue": "={{$json.mode}}", "rightValue": "new", "operator": {"type": "string", "operation": "equals"}}], "combinator": "and"}, "options": {}}, "id": "d4", "name": "D4 new?", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if", "typeVersion": 2.2, "position": [560, 840]},
    {"parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "https://api.razorpay.com/v1/payment_links", "authentication": "genericCredentialType", "genericAuthType": "httpBasicAuth", "sendBody": true, "specifyBody": "json", "jsonBody": "={ \"amount\": {{ Number($json.Amount)*100 }}, \"currency\": \"INR\", \"description\": {{ JSON.stringify(($json.Purpose||'Jewellery payment')+' — '+($env.BRAND_NAME||'')) }}, \"customer\": { \"name\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.Customer) }}, \"contact\": {{ JSON.stringify('+91'+String($json.Phone).replace(/\\\\D/g,'').slice(-10)) }}, }, \"notify\": { \"sms\": true } }", "options": {"response": {"response": {"neverError": true}}}}, "id": "d5", "name": "D5 Razorpay link", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [740, 780], "credentials": {"httpBasicAuth": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Razorpay Keys"}}},
    {"parameters": {"operation": "update", "documentId": {"__rl": true, "value": "REPLACE_SHEET_ID", "mode": "id"}, "sheetName": {"__rl": true, "value": "Dues", "mode": "name"}, "columns": {"mappingMode": "defineBelow", "value": {"row_number": "={{ $('D4 new?').item.json.row_number }}", "LinkSent": "={{ $now.toISO().slice(0,10) }}"}, "matchingColumns": ["row_number"]}, "options": {}}, "id": "d6", "name": "D6 mark sent", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets", "typeVersion": 4.5, "position": [920, 780], "credentials": {"googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Google Sheets"}}},
    {"parameters": {"operation": "sendMessage", "chatId": "={{$env.TG_OWNER_CHAT_ID}}", "text": "={{ $json.mode==='chase' ? '💬 CHASE: '+$json.Customer+' ₹'+$json.Amount+' → https://wa.me/'+String($json.Phone).replace(/\\D/g,'')+'?text='+encodeURIComponent('Namaste '+$json.Customer+' ji! Gentle reminder about the pending ₹'+$json.Amount+' — thank you 🙏') : '💳 LINK for '+$json.Customer+' ₹'+$json.Amount+': '+($('D5 Razorpay link').item?.json?.short_url||'(creating…)')+' → https://wa.me/'+String($json.Phone).replace(/\\D/g,'')+'?text='+encodeURIComponent('Namaste '+$json.Customer+' ji! Payment link: '+($('D5 Razorpay link').item?.json?.short_url||'')) }}", "additionalFields": {}}, "id": "d7", "name": "D7 pay/chase msg", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram", "typeVersion": 1.2, "position": [740, 900], "credentials": {"telegramApi": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Jeweller Bot"}}},
    {"parameters": {"content": "## E · NIGHT BLOCK 21:30 — Zoho sync + recon + backup + digest", "height": 70, "width": 1000}, "id": "sE", "name": "SecE", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [0, 1020]},
